# whose constructor attaches the shared DRACOLoader + window.MeshoptDecoder (if present). Call-site chains such as
# `new THREE.GLTFLoader().setMeshoptDecoder(window.MeshoptDecoder)` (patch_wardrobe) keep working unchanged.
# IKKI_URL -> quest-draco GLB (?ikki=orig -> original GLB, ?ikki=<url> override). Idempotent.
# KTX2 CANDIDATE (Rydah Optimizer, NOT merged): stage 2 below adds an opt-in KTX2 path, gated on ?ktx2=1. Default path untouched:
#  stage 1 (Draco+meshopt) is byte-identical to patch_draco.py; stage 2 adds one gate script that returns immediately without ?ktx2=1.
#  Target file override for dry runs: SR_HTML=/tmp/x.html python3 patch_draco.py.ktx2-candidate
